The test's `toBusinessDay` (lines 267-274) skips these, and the AcceptanceTest javadoc (lines 9-11) claims "the default registration date rolls past public holidays as well as weekends" — but the actual `BusinessDayAdjuster.toBusinessDay` only rolls Saturday/Sunday and would return a holiday weekday unchanged. Also note the two implementations differ in strategy: production uses fixed `plusDays(2)`/`plusDays(1)` jumps, while the test uses a `plusDays(1)` loop.

